    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Kadane</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DP 1D</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/maximum-subarray/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 53</a></div>\n  <h1>Maximum Subarray</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: the best subarray ending at i either extends the best one ending at i-1 or starts fresh at i, so a negative running sum is thrown away. Kadane, one pass, O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
